{"id":"d782096c679079e3","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-true-arithmetic.md","title":"True Arithmetic","display":"df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-true-arithmetic","aliases":["92-df-true-arithmetic"],"display":"df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-true-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-true-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-true-arithmetic-—-True-Arithmetic-$\\mathrm{TA}$\">df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (external truth predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span> (definition-target true-arithmetic theory)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}true\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\mathrm{TA}_G\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}true\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\mathrm{TA}_G\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}\\)</span> : 真算术（在标准模型中真的句子集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在标准模型中真</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>对标准自然数模型可靠，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>对有效可公理化、足够强且满足所需可靠性或一致性条件的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，不完备性定理给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span>；这不是任意形式系统都满足的定义事实</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span>既不可判定也不可c.e.，并且没有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-语言公式在标准模型中定义其完整句子码集；这三个结论相关但不是“不可形式化”一个短语的同义反复</li>\n<li>对相应理论构造的标准Gödel句，只有保留有效性、强度及一致性条件后，才能断言它真而不可证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-true-arithmetic-—-True-Arithmetic-$\\mathrm{TA}$","text":"df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic $\\mathrm{TA}$","level":1},{"i